{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2010,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"La hipotenusa de un triángulo rectángulo mide 90 cm. Si se hace girar alrededor de uno de sus catetos, el triángulo engendra un cono. ¿Qué medidas han de tener los catetos del triángulo para que el volumen del cono engendrado sea máximo? (Recuerda que el volumen del cono es \\(V=\\frac13\\pi r^2h\\)).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Al girar alrededor del cateto \\(h\\), el otro cateto \\(r\\) es el radio de la base. Por el teorema de Pitágoras, \\(r^2+h^2=90^2=8100\\Rightarrow r^2=8100-h^2\\).</p><p><b>Función a maximizar:</b> el volumen.</p>\\[V(h)=\\frac13\\pi(8100-h^2)\\,h=\\frac\\pi3(8100h-h^3),\\qquad h\\in(0,90)\\]<p>Es polinómica<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(V'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[V'(h)=\\frac\\pi3(8100-3h^2)=0\\iff h^2=2700\\iff\\boxed{h=30\\sqrt3\\approx51{,}96}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>30√3</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>90</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>V</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>V</tspan>′(60) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(V\\) crece en \\((0,30\\sqrt3)\\) debido a que \\(V'(h)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((30\\sqrt3,90)\\) debido a que \\(V'(h)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. El máximo está en \\(h=30\\sqrt3\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, con \\(r=\\sqrt{8100-2700}=\\sqrt{5400}=30\\sqrt6\\).</p><div class='res'>El cateto de giro mide \\(30\\sqrt3\\approx51{,}96\\) cm y el otro \\(30\\sqrt6\\approx73{,}48\\) cm</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera las funciones \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=2-x^2\\) y \\(g(x)=|x|\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Esboza sus gráficas en unos mismos ejes coordenados.","(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es una parábola hacia abajo con vértice \\((0,2)\\); \\(g\\) son dos semirrectas desde el origen. Las dos son pares. Cortes con \\(x\\ge0\\): \\(2-x^2=x\\iff x^2+x-2=0\\iff x=1\\) (la otra raíz, \\(-2\\), no es \\(\\ge0\\)); por simetría, \\(x=-1\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='90.9,87.4 92.9,84.6 94.8,81.9 96.8,79.4 98.8,76.9 100.8,74.5 102.7,72.2 104.7,70.0 106.7,67.9 108.6,65.9 110.6,64.0 112.6,62.2 114.5,60.4 116.5,58.8 118.5,57.2 120.5,55.8 122.4,54.4 124.4,53.2 126.4,52.0 128.3,50.9 130.3,49.9 132.3,49.1 134.2,48.3 136.2,47.6 138.2,46.9 140.2,46.4 142.1,46.0 144.1,45.7 146.1,45.5 148.0,45.3 150.0,45.3 152.0,45.3 153.9,45.5 155.9,45.7 157.9,46.0 159.8,46.4 161.8,46.9 163.8,47.6 165.8,48.3 167.7,49.1 169.7,49.9 171.7,50.9 173.6,52.0 175.6,53.2 177.6,54.4 179.5,55.8 181.5,57.2 183.5,58.8 185.5,60.4 187.4,62.2 189.4,64.0 191.4,65.9 193.3,67.9 195.3,70.0 197.3,72.2 199.2,74.5 201.2,76.9 203.2,79.4 205.2,81.9 207.1,84.6 209.1,87.4 209.1,87.4 207.1,88.8 205.2,90.2 203.2,91.6 201.2,93.0 199.2,94.4 197.3,95.8 195.3,97.2 193.3,98.6 191.4,100.0 189.4,101.4 187.4,102.8 185.5,104.2 183.5,105.6 181.5,107.0 179.5,108.4 177.6,109.8 175.6,111.2 173.6,112.6 171.7,114.0 169.7,115.4 167.7,116.8 165.8,118.2 163.8,119.6 161.8,121.1 159.8,122.5 157.9,123.9 155.9,125.3 153.9,126.7 152.0,128.1 150.0,129.5 148.0,128.1 146.1,126.7 144.1,125.3 142.1,123.9 140.2,122.5 138.2,121.1 136.2,119.6 134.2,118.2 132.3,116.8 130.3,115.4 128.3,114.0 126.4,112.6 124.4,111.2 122.4,109.8 120.5,108.4 118.5,107.0 116.5,105.6 114.5,104.2 112.6,102.8 110.6,101.4 108.6,100.0 106.7,98.6 104.7,97.2 102.7,95.8 100.8,94.4 98.8,93.0 96.8,91.6 94.8,90.2 92.9,88.8 90.9,87.4' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='37.7,197.3 41.5,187.3 45.2,177.7 49.0,168.4 52.7,159.4 56.4,150.8 60.2,142.5 63.9,134.6 67.7,127.0 71.4,119.7 75.2,112.8 78.9,106.2 82.6,100.0 86.4,94.1 90.1,88.5 93.9,83.3 97.6,78.4 101.3,73.8 105.1,69.6 108.8,65.7 112.6,62.2 116.3,58.9 120.1,56.1 123.8,53.5 127.5,51.3 131.3,49.5 135.0,48.0 138.8,46.8 142.5,45.9 146.3,45.4 150.0,45.3 153.7,45.4 157.5,45.9 161.2,46.8 165.0,48.0 168.7,49.5 172.5,51.3 176.2,53.5 179.9,56.1 183.7,58.9 187.4,62.2 191.2,65.7 194.9,69.6 198.7,73.8 202.4,78.4 206.1,83.3 209.9,88.5 213.6,94.1 217.4,100.0 221.1,106.2 224.8,112.8 228.6,119.7 232.3,127.0 236.1,134.6 239.8,142.5 243.6,150.8 247.3,159.4 251.0,168.4 254.8,177.7 258.5,187.3 262.3,197.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,36.8 26.5,41.5 33.0,46.1 39.5,50.7 46.0,55.4 52.5,60.0 59.0,64.6 65.5,69.3 72.0,73.9 78.5,78.5 85.0,83.2 91.5,87.8 98.0,92.4 104.5,97.1 111.0,101.7 117.5,106.3 124.0,110.9 130.5,115.6 137.0,120.2 143.5,124.8 150.0,129.5 156.5,124.8 163.0,120.2 169.5,115.6 176.0,110.9 182.5,106.3 189.0,101.7 195.5,97.1 202.0,92.4 208.5,87.8 215.0,83.2 221.5,78.5 228.0,73.9 234.5,69.3 241.0,64.6 247.5,60.0 254.0,55.4 260.5,50.7 267.0,46.1 273.5,41.5 280.0,36.8' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='90.9' cy='87.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='46.9' y='83.4'>(−1,1)</text><circle cx='209.1' cy='87.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='215.1' y='83.4'>(1,1)</text><text x='232.7' y='121.1' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='250.5' y='41.1' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>g</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 129.5H294.0M150.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='31.8' y1='126.5' x2='31.8' y2='132.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='28.8' y='143.5' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='90.9' y1='126.5' x2='90.9' y2='132.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='87.9' y='143.5' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='209.1' y1='126.5' x2='209.1' y2='132.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='206.1' y='143.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='268.2' y1='126.5' x2='268.2' y2='132.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='265.2' y='143.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='87.4' x2='153.0' y2='87.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='91.4' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='45.3' x2='153.0' y2='45.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='49.3' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-1\\) y \\(1\\), \\(f\\) queda por encima. Por la simetría:</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^1(2-x^2-x)\\,dx=2\\Bigl[2x-\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac{x^2}2\\Bigr]_0^1=2\\left(2-\\frac13-\\frac12\\right)=\\frac73\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac73\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&-4&2\\\\2&-1&1\\\\-4&4&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Comprueba que se verifica \\(2A-A^2=I\\).","(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(A^{-1}\\). (Sugerencia: puedes usar la igualdad del apartado (a))."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & 2\\\\2 & -1 & 1\\\\-4 & 4 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -4 & 2\\\\2 & -1 & 1\\\\-4 & 4 & -1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}9 & -8 & 4\\\\4 & -3 & 2\\\\-8 & 8 & -3\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[2A-A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}10 & -8 & 4\\\\4 & -2 & 2\\\\-8 & 8 & -2\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}9 & -8 & 4\\\\4 & -3 & 2\\\\-8 & 8 & -3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=I\\ ✓\\]<div class='res'>Se verifica \\(2A-A^2=I\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Saco \\(A\\) factor común por la izquierda<i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(2A-A^2=A(2I-A)\\), porque \\(A\\cdot I=A\\).</i>:</p>\\[A(2I-A)=I\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=2I-A\\]\\[A^{-1}=2I-A=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 4 & -2\\\\-2 & 3 & -1\\\\4 & -4 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 4 & -2\\\\-2 & 3 & -1\\\\4 & -4 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ops","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula el área del triángulo cuyos vértices son los puntos de intersección del plano \\(6x+3y+2z=6\\) con los ejes de coordenadas.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Cortes con los ejes:</b> \\(A(1,0,0)\\), \\(B(0,2,0)\\), \\(C(0,0,3)\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&2&0\\\\-1&0&3\\end{vmatrix}=(6,\\,3,\\,2)\\]<p>El área es la mitad de su módulo<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|\\vec u\\times\\vec v|\\) es el área del paralelogramo; el triángulo es la mitad.</i>:</p>\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\sqrt{36+9+4}=\\frac72\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":27,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,0,0],[0,2,0],[0,0,3]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[1,0,0],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,2,0],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,0,3],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"pt\",[1,0,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,2,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,3],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m10r4a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m10r4a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m10r4a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m10r4a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='26.0,245.6 188.7,246.0 59.0,18.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='59.0' y1='225.6' x2='26.0' y2='245.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='59.0' y1='225.6' x2='188.7' y2='246.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='59.0' y1='225.6' x2='59.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='245.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='239.6' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='188.7' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='195.7' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='59.0' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='66.0' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='16.7' y2='274.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='11.2' y='279.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.3' y2='272.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.2' y='277.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac72\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2010-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2010-reserva-4-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f\\) la función definida como \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{x^2-1}\\) para \\(x\\neq\\pm1\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Estudia y halla las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).","(0,75 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).","(0,75 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> el denominador se anula en \\(x=\\pm1\\) y el numerador no:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to1^\\pm}\\frac{x^3}{x^2-1}=\\frac1{0^\\pm}=\\pm\\infty,\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to-1^\\pm}\\frac{x^3}{x^2-1}=\\frac{-1}{0^\\mp}=\\pm\\infty\\]<p>\\(x=1\\) y \\(x=-1\\) son asíntotas verticales.</p><p><b>Horizontal:</b> no hay (el grado del numerador es mayor). <b>Oblicua</b> \\(y=mx+n\\):</p>\\[m=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^3}{x^3-x}=1,\\qquad n=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^3}{x^2-1}-x\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac x{x^2-1}=0\\]<div class='res'>Asíntotas verticales \\(x=1\\) y \\(x=-1\\); asíntota oblicua \\(y=x\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x=\\pm1\\) son puntos «problemáticos»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{3x^2(x^2-1)-2x\\cdot x^3}{(x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{x^2(x^2-3)}{(x^2-1)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=\\pm\\sqrt3}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 520 108' width='100%' style='max-width:624px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H506' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−√3</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><circle cx='178' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M342 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='342' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><circle cx='342' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M424 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='424' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>√3</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1,5) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−½) &lt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M289.0 10L325.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 39L325.0 40L323.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(½) &lt; 0</text><text x='357.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M371.0 10L407.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M398.0 39L407.0 40L405.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='383.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text><text x='439.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M453.0 40L489.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M480.0 11L489.0 10L487.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='465.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-\\sqrt3)\\) y \\((\\sqrt3,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((-\\sqrt3,-1)\\), \\((-1,1)\\) y \\((1,\\sqrt3)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. (En \\(x=0\\) no hay extremo: \\(f'\\) no cambia de signo.)</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,-\\sqrt3)\\cup(\\sqrt3,+\\infty)\\); decrece en \\((-\\sqrt3,-1)\\cup(-1,1)\\cup(1,\\sqrt3)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es impar. Máximo relativo en \\(\\left(-\\sqrt3,-\\frac{3\\sqrt3}2\\right)\\), mínimo relativo en \\(\\left(\\sqrt3,\\frac{3\\sqrt3}2\\right)\\), pasa por el origen y se acerca a \\(y=x\\) en los extremos:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 240' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,191.1 21.2,190.6 22.4,190.0 23.5,189.4 24.7,188.9 25.9,188.3 27.1,187.8 28.3,187.2 29.5,186.7 30.6,186.1 31.8,185.6 33.0,185.0 34.2,184.5 35.4,183.9 36.6,183.4 37.7,182.8 38.9,182.3 40.1,181.8 41.3,181.2 42.5,180.7 43.6,180.2 44.8,179.6 46.0,179.1 47.2,178.6 48.4,178.1 49.6,177.5 50.7,177.0 51.9,176.5 53.1,176.0 54.3,175.5 55.5,175.0 56.6,174.5 57.8,174.0 59.0,173.5 60.2,173.0 61.4,172.5 62.6,172.0 63.7,171.6 64.9,171.1 66.1,170.6 67.3,170.2 68.5,169.7 69.7,169.3 70.8,168.8 72.0,168.4 73.2,168.0 74.4,167.6 75.6,167.2 76.7,166.8 77.9,166.4 79.1,166.0 80.3,165.7 81.5,165.3 82.7,165.0 83.8,164.7 85.0,164.4 86.2,164.2 87.4,164.0 88.6,163.7 89.7,163.6 90.9,163.4 92.1,163.4 93.3,163.3 94.5,163.3 95.7,163.4 96.8,163.5 98.0,163.8 99.2,164.1 100.4,164.6 101.6,165.2 102.8,166.0 103.9,167.0 105.1,168.4 106.3,170.1 107.5,172.4 108.7,175.5 109.8,179.7 111.0,185.6 112.2,194.4 113.4,208.6 114.6,234.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='119.8,20.8 120.5,50.1 121.3,67.6 122.0,79.2 122.8,87.4 123.6,93.4 124.3,98.1 125.1,101.7 125.8,104.6 126.6,107.0 127.3,109.0 128.1,110.6 128.8,112.0 129.6,113.2 130.4,114.2 131.1,115.1 131.9,115.8 132.6,116.4 133.4,117.0 134.1,117.5 134.9,117.9 135.6,118.2 136.4,118.5 137.2,118.8 137.9,119.0 138.7,119.2 139.4,119.4 140.2,119.5 14