>Dos rectas de pendientes \\(m\\) y \\(m'\\) son perpendiculares si \\(m\\cdot m'=-1\\).</i>:</p>\\[y-1=-e(x-e)\\iff y=-ex+1+e^2\\ ✓\\]<div class='res'>Es la recta normal en \\(x=e\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La normal corta al eje \\(OX\\) en \\(-ex+1+e^2=0\\iff x=e+\\frac1e\\). El recinto va de \\(x=1\\) (donde \\(\\ln x=0\\)) a \\(x=e+\\frac1e\\): por arriba \\(\\ln x\\) hasta \\(e\\) y luego la normal.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='111.4,122.6 113.2,120.9 115.0,119.2 116.8,117.5 118.7,115.8 120.5,114.2 122.3,112.7 124.2,111.2 126.0,109.7 127.8,108.2 129.7,106.8 131.5,105.4 133.3,104.0 135.2,102.7 137.0,101.3 138.8,100.0 140.7,98.8 142.5,97.5 144.3,96.3 146.2,95.1 148.0,93.9 149.8,92.8 151.7,91.6 153.5,90.5 155.3,89.4 157.2,88.3 159.0,87.2 160.8,86.2 162.7,85.1 164.5,84.1 166.3,83.1 168.2,82.1 170.0,81.1 171.8,80.2 173.7,79.2 175.5,78.3 177.3,77.3 179.2,76.4 181.0,75.5 182.8,74.6 184.6,73.7 186.5,72.9 188.3,72.0 190.1,71.2 192.0,70.3 193.8,69.5 195.6,68.7 197.5,67.9 199.3,67.1 201.1,66.3 203.0,65.5 204.8,64.8 206.6,64.0 208.5,63.2 210.3,62.5 212.1,61.8 214.0,61.0 215.8,60.3 217.6,59.6 219.5,58.9 221.3,58.2 223.1,57.5 225.0,56.8 226.8,56.1 228.6,55.5 230.5,54.8 232.3,54.7 234.1,59.6 236.0,64.4 237.8,69.3 239.6,74.1 241.5,79.0 243.3,83.8 245.1,88.7 247.0,93.5 248.8,98.4 250.6,103.2 252.4,108.1 254.3,112.9 256.1,117.8 257.9,122.6 257.9,122.6 256.1,122.6 254.3,122.6 252.4,122.6 250.6,122.6 248.8,122.6 247.0,122.6 245.1,122.6 243.3,122.6 241.5,122.6 239.6,122.6 237.8,122.6 236.0,122.6 234.1,122.6 232.3,122.6 230.5,122.6 228.6,122.6 226.8,122.6 225.0,122.6 223.1,122.6 221.3,122.6 219.5,122.6 217.6,122.6 215.8,122.6 214.0,122.6 212.1,122.6 210.3,122.6 208.5,122.6 206.6,122.6 204.8,122.6 203.0,122.6 201.1,122.6 199.3,122.6 197.5,122.6 195.6,122.6 193.8,122.6 192.0,122.6 190.1,122.6 